OL,3,GNEWSAWomen runners urged to share
OL,4,Asafety fears in survey
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police has asked women
OL,7,Fand girls who regularly jog or run to
OL,8,Ftake part in a survey, as part of its
OL,9,Fcampaign to tackle violence.
OL,11,FThe force said people could share their
OL,12,Fexperiences anonymously, with the
OL,13,Fsurvey asking about issues including
OL,14,Fharassment, cat-calling and feeling
OL,15,Funsafe while running alone.
OL,17,FThe survey also asks women whether they
OL,18,Ftake precautions such as sharing their
OL,19,Flocation with someone before heading
OL,20,Fout, and whether they report incidents
OL,21,Fto police.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
